      en: ["Core zone of the Elteschmuel Nature Reserve", "Mosaic of reed beds and open water surfaces", "Occurrence of over 20 different dragonfly species", "Important filter function for the water quality of the Attert", "Protection of rare bog plants such as bogbean", "Part of the national strategy for the preservation of wetlands"],
